# Line-ending policy for this repo.
#
# There is no thirdparty/ here any more. The rule that exempted it from line-ending
# handling moved to ../edge/.gitattributes with picoquic and picotls, which are the only
# vendored copies weft still holds.
#
# Everything this repo owns: normalize to LF on checkin regardless of
# what line ending a given checkout produced, and check out as LF. This
# is a Linux and POSIX server codebase, so CRLF has no reason to appear.
*.c text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.hpp text eol=lf
*.cc text eol=lf
CMakeLists.txt text eol=lf
*.cmake text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf

# Binary, never subject to any text handling.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
